            <ArticleTitle>Endoscopic resection of a distal femoral osteochondroma: description of the technique and case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>23E</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This report describes the successful endoscopic treatment of an osteochondroma of the distal femur. We discuss the surgical technique and the case report of a distal femoral osteochondroma that was endoscopically resected without any complications. This technique allows performing a resection that involves minimum morbidity and a prompt functional recovery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
